    {"\n内存容量不是当前可分配量；渲染提交不是面板 FPS。会话编号不是启动计数。本报告不等于崩溃日志；缓冲丢弃/传输缺口不能被解释为完整记录。\n","\nMemory capacity is not the amount currently allocatable; render submissions are not panel FPS. A session ID is not a boot count. This report is not a crash log; a record with dropped buffers or transfer gaps must not be treated as complete.\n",NULL},
    {"\n前3秒完整显示，随后小提示；10秒后释放亮屏保持，随后按系统息屏。短按暂停/继续，长按停止并退出（TFP1-04）；手机断连也可操作。抬头需开启原厂头控；到时空闲才提醒。重启眼镜会中断本轮计时。","\nShow the full timer for the first 3 seconds, then a small hint; release the keep-awake setting after 10 seconds and follow the system screen-off timer. Short press to pause/resume; long press to stop and exit (TFP1-04). Works even when the phone disconnects. Raise-to-wake requires the factory head-control feature. When time is up, alerts appear only while the glasses are idle. Restarting the glasses interrupts this timer.",NULL},
