    {"仅用于新 N8 / N8W 测试固件。必须亲眼看到眼镜 Turbo Image RX 页上的 SID；原厂/R3 不支持。输入当前 SID 后 30 秒内点发送。本轮最多一张，SDK 收到文件不代表镜片显示，需人工验收。不会触发 OTA。","For new N8 / N8W test firmware only. You must see the SID on the glasses Turbo Image RX page; stock firmware / R3 are unsupported. Enter the current SID and tap Send within 30 seconds. One image maximum per session. SDK file receipt does not prove the image appeared on the glasses; verify manually. Does not trigger OTA.",NULL},
    {"仅研究日志路径。测试前关闭手机互联网但保留蓝牙，结束其他眼镜任务；不要同时操作官方反馈。已保存且校验通过后，可手动请求新一轮，保留旧归档与隔离记录；不会自动重试。超时或结果未知仍禁止重发。最多保留32轮任务隔离，达到上限由Mac检查。隔离不是全App网络防火墙。","Only the research log path is tested. Before testing, turn off phone internet, keep Bluetooth on, and end other glasses tasks; do not use RayNeo app log feedback at the same time. After saving and validating, you may manually request another run; old archives and isolation records are retained. No automatic retries. Resending is prohibited after a timeout or unknown result. Up to 32 task runs are retained in isolation; at the limit, have them checked on a Mac. Isolation is not an app-wide network firewall.",NULL},
