    {"先在官方App停止本次全天智记，再刷新并选文件分享。仅列出官方智记调试sessions目录，不含mock输入或字幕音频。实时/缓存可能是不同分段，不自动拼接、不承诺无缺包。PCM是原始格式，不能直接当WAV播放。","Stop this All-day Lifelog session in the RayNeo app first, then refresh and choose files to share. Lists only the RayNeo app Lifelog debug sessions directory; excludes mock input and caption audio. Live and cached audio may be separate segments; they are not joined automatically, and missing packets are possible. PCM is raw audio and cannot be played directly as WAV.",NULL},
    {"先在官方录音详情：分享 → 音频，生成所需格式。这里列出已生成的文件，不自动对应当前详情；请核对名称和时间。点击后分享独立副本，可选 AirDrop 或存储到文件。不会生成公开链接，不删原录音。","On the RayNeo app recording details page, choose Share → Audio to create the desired format first. This list shows files already created and does not automatically match the current detail page; check the name and time. Tap a file to share a separate copy via AirDrop or Save to Files. No public link is created, and the original recording is not deleted.",NULL},
    {"先在手机选图，再在眼镜打开 Turbo Image RX；这样不会浪费眼镜 120 秒的窗口。","Choose an image on the phone first, then open Turbo Image RX on the glasses; this avoids wasting the glasses’ 120-second window.",NULL},
    {"先在眼镜打开Turbo Display，再启动高德模拟","Open Turbo Display on the glasses first, then start AMap simulation",NULL},
    {"先在眼镜进入 Turbo Display SID 页面。只查询一次，5秒无匹配回执停止；不根据旧提示猜测固件版本。","First open the Turbo Display SID page on the glasses. Sends only one query and stops if no matching acknowledgement arrives within 5 seconds. Does not guess the firmware version from an old notice.",NULL},
    {"先导入或粘贴完整转写，最多 30 万字符。不自动读取剪贴板或把屏幕几段当作全文。","Import or paste the complete transcript first (up to 300,000 characters). Clipboard is not read automatically, and a few visible lines are not treated as the full transcript.",NULL},
    {"先开启遥控，再从手表连接雷鸟插件","Turn on remote control first, then connect the RayNeo plugin from your Watch.",NULL},
    {"先成功发送一次完整导航示例图，再点本项。只发送差异，最多32块；不是实时导航，不自动连续发送。","First send a full navigation sample image successfully, then tap this item. Sends differences only, up to 32 blocks; not live navigation and does not send continuously.",NULL},
    {"先预览范围，再确认发送文字","Preview the scope, then confirm to send the text",NULL},
    {"入口顺序、实体按键和 Apple Watch 遥控不变。眼镜保存后重启仍生效；首次升级默认三排。切换不会退出当前应用或唤醒屏幕，回菜单后查看。旧固件必须先更新 TMG2；无能力回执不会发送修改。","Entry order, physical buttons, and Apple Watch Remote stay unchanged. The glasses retain the saved layout after restart; the first upgrade defaults to three rows. Switching does not exit the current app or wake the display; return to the menu to see it. Older firmware must be updated to TMG2 first; without a capability acknowledgement, no change is sent.",NULL},
