    {"只发临时设置，不发字幕录音启动；等待同SID回执后才能发A。4分钟保护；锁屏/离开时请求退出。","Sends only temporary settings, not a command to start caption recording. Wait for the same-SID acknowledgement before sending A. Four-minute safety timer; requests exit when the phone locks or you leave this page.",NULL},
    {"只发给当前配对眼镜，不上传云端、不刷固件。真实文件吞吐待验，超时后不会盲目重发。","Only sends to the currently paired glasses. No cloud upload or firmware flashing. Real file throughput is not yet verified; no blind retry after a timeout.",NULL},
