    {"只查询 Mac 已归档数据，不刷新微信、不读实时数据库。命中片段经 Codex 处理，答案会交给当前自有模型。","Searches only archived data on the Mac; does not refresh WeChat or read the live database. Matching excerpts are processed by Codex, and the answer is sent to the current custom model.",NULL},
